# Deploy every update to Vercel

After finishing a user-requested change to this project, ship it to production. Do not wait to be asked again.

1. Commit the relevant files (never secrets, `.env*`, or `.vercel`).
2. Push `master` to `origin` (`https://github.com/RobinMalatji/mohao-tech.git`).
3. Confirm the Vercel production deploy for `mohao-tech` succeeds (`vercel ls` or the GitHub check). If GitHub auto-deploy fails, run `vercel --prod`.
4. Tell the user the live URL: https://mohao-tech.vercel.app
